#. Translators: link title in the About dialog.
#: src/window.rs:905
msgid "Contribute Translations"
msgstr "Kevri Treylyansow"

#. Translators: name of https://gitlab.gnome.org/YaLTeR/identity
#: src/window.rs:911
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "Honanieth"

#. Translators: summary of https://gitlab.gnome.org/YaLTeR/identity
#: src/window.rs:913
msgid "Compare images and videos"
msgstr "Komparya avenyow ha gwydhyowyow"

#: src/window.rs:920
msgid ""
"This release improves the default output file naming and adds command-line "
"options."
msgstr ""
"An dyllans ma gwellhe an henwyn restren eskorrans defowt hag addya dewisyow "
"arghadow-linen."

#: src/window.rs:921
msgid "The default output filename now includes start and end timestamps."
msgstr ""
"An hanow restren eskorrans defowt synsi termynyow dalleth ha diwedh lemmyn."

#: src/window.rs:922
msgid ""
"Added command-line flags for start and end timestamps, precise trimming, and "
"removing audio."
msgstr ""
"Addys baneryow arghadow-linen rag termynyow dalleth ha diwedh, godreghans "
"kewar, hag ow remova son."

#: src/window.rs:923
msgid "Increased the default window size to make the video 960×540."
msgstr "Kressys an braster fenester defowt rag gul an gwydhyow 960×540."

#: src/window.rs:924
msgid "Updated to the GNOME 50 platform."
msgstr "Nowedhys dhe'n vynk GNOME 50."

#: src/window.rs:925
msgid "Updated translations."
msgstr "Nowedhys treylyansow."

